    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "25.5 x 20.5cm, 34pp plus stapled wrappers. The second edition (the first edition was in 1967) of these concrete poems by Nichol which were issued as one of the Writers Forum Quartos Nr 3. Several later editions were also published in different formats. The front cover has some browning at the top else VG+. Scarce even as a second edition.Add to basket"
